# Hush — KDE Plasma 6 color scheme
# Palette: 16 colors in 4 tiers (Hearth, Glow, Mist, Spark). Source of truth: ~/projects/kde-theme/palette-preview.svg
#   Hearth (surfaces):  #242424 #2B2B2B #333333 #444444
#   Glow (warm fgs):    #A89986 #D4BC91 #E1CDA5 #E1E1E1
#   Mist (cool accents): #7AA8AC #88A6C5 #A8BDD6
#   Spark (vivid):       red #E06C75  orange #D19A66  amber #E5C07B  green #98C379  violet #C586B0
# Negative=spark.red, Neutral=spark.amber, Positive=spark.green, Visited=spark.violet (web-link convention).

